3286	3407	### Assessment

GLOBSEC is the most explicitly NATO-aligned think tank in this dataset after the Atlantic Council itself.
3408	3580	Its US government funding (NED, US Embassy), its governance ties to NATO, and its programmatic focus make it structurally Atlanticist rather than merely orientationally so.
